      { question: 'Are outdoor cameras weatherproof for Texas heat and storms?', answer: 'All outdoor cameras feature IP67 weatherproof seals for rain, wind, and heat.' },
      { question: 'Do you offer free written estimates?', answer: 'Yes, we provide free on-site walks and line-item written estimates.' }
