    'Luxury estate installations demand invisible wire runs inside stone or timber architecture, custom powder-coated camera fixtures, underground conduit trenching, and total technician discretion. Fort Worth Security Cameras delivers elite estate video systems.',
    'We engineer custom estate camera systems across Fort Worth, Southlake, Colleyville, Keller, Grapevine, Clearfork, the Cultural District and Camp Bowie estate streets, and the acreage and equestrian properties west toward Weatherford. Gate and perimeter layouts are designed around the property line, so coverage never reaches into a neighboring yard, patio, pool, or window, and no camera is ever placed inside private living space. We coordinate with architects, builders, landscape contractors, and smart home integrators before any trench is opened or any stone is core drilled, and we integrate video into existing Control4, Crestron, or Savant interfaces. Exterior hardware is IP67 and IK10 rated with surge protection and proper grounding for North Texas hail, lightning, and sustained triple digit heat, while recorders stay in a conditioned equipment room the owner controls. Technicians are licensed, background checked, and work under nondisclosure.',
