    'We install exterior camera systems for vacation rentals, lake houses, extended stay properties, corporate housing, and seasonal second homes across Fort Worth and Tarrant County, including water adjacent properties around Eagle Mountain Lake, Lake Worth, and Benbrook Lake, neighborhoods near the Stockyards, the Cultural District, Clearfork, and the Near Southside, and homes along the Chisholm Trail Parkway, I-30, I-35W, and Loop 820 corridors. Coverage is exterior only, disclosed in the listing, and aimed to stay inside the property line so no camera frames a neighboring home, window, yard, or pool, and no camera is placed inside the house. We coordinate fixture finishes with association architectural review where the property sits in a managed community, seal every penetration against wind driven rain, rate exterior hardware for North Texas hail and triple digit heat, and add a cellular backup uplink where broadband is unreliable.',
